<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:46:30 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>通过利用术后血脑屏障破坏将治疗性纳米颗粒靶向胶质母细胞瘤切除边缘</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/targeting-therapeutic-nanoparticles-to-the-glioblastoma-resection-margin-by-harnessing-postoperative-bloodbrain-barrier-disruption</link><description>术后短暂的血脑屏障通透性窗口使得临床上使用的脂质体纳米粒子能够重新用于治疗胶质母细胞瘤。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/targeting-therapeutic-nanoparticles-to-the-glioblastoma-resection-margin-by-harnessing-postoperative-bloodbrain-barrier-disruption2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:46:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/targeting-therapeutic-nanoparticles-to-the-glioblastoma-resection-margin-by-harnessing-postoperative-bloodbrain-barrier-disruption</guid></item><item><title>体外膜肺氧合患者的肾脏替代治疗：叙述性回顾</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/renal-replacement-therapy-in-patients-under-extracorporeal-membrane-oxygenation-a-narrative-review</link><description>体外膜肺氧合 (ECMO) 的使用已扩大用于治疗严重的呼吸和循环衰竭。急性肾损伤（AKI）是最常见的并发症之一。高达 85% 的 ECMO 患者出现 AKI，其中大约一半需要肾脏替代治疗 (RRT)，因此全面了解这两种疗法及其相互作用对于患者管理至关重要。然而，指导 ECMO 特定 RRT 策略的证据仍然有限。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/renal-replacement-therapy-in-patients-under-extracorporeal-membrane-oxygenation-a-narrative-review2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:31:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/renal-replacement-therapy-in-patients-under-extracorporeal-membrane-oxygenation-a-narrative-review</guid></item><item><title>化学家用氟化钾解锁了阿佩尔氟化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/chemists-unlock-appel-fluorination-with-potassium-fluoride</link><description>醇是化学中最丰富的组成部分之一。与此同时，氟化化合物对于许多现代药物、作物保护产品和先进材料至关重要。然而，将一种物质转化为另一种物质，传统上依赖于有毒、热不稳定的试剂，例如 DAST（二乙氨基三氟化硫），这使得大规模生产的操作要求很高。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chemists-unlock-appel-fluorination-with-potassium-fluoride2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:16:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/chemists-unlock-appel-fluorination-with-potassium-fluoride</guid></item><item><title>婴儿的眼神接触“调节”说话者的脑电波并学习语言</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/infants-eye-contact-tune-in-to-speakers-brainwaves-and-learn-language</link><description>科学家表明，婴儿通过与说话者的目光接触来确定要注意的内容并同步他们的脑电波，从而帮助他们学习语言。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/infants-eye-contact-tune-in-to-speakers-brainwaves-and-learn-language2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 01:01:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/infants-eye-contact-tune-in-to-speakers-brainwaves-and-learn-language</guid></item><item><title>量子计算机有望带来数学超能力</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/quantum-computers-promise-mathematical-superpowers</link><description>但就像所有的超级大国一样，他们也有其局限性&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/quantum-computers-promise-mathematical-superpowers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:46:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/quantum-computers-promise-mathematical-superpowers</guid></item><item><title>KRAS4A 促进线粒体上己糖激酶 1 的寡聚化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/kras4a-promotes-oligomerization-of-hexokinase-1-on-mitochondria</link><description>该网站使用安全服务来防范恶意机器人。当网站验证您不是机器人时会显示此页面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/kras4a-promotes-oligomerization-of-hexokinase-1-on-mitochondria.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 00:31:28 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/07/kras4a-promotes-oligomerization-of-hexoki